  {
   "index": 3,
   "tag": "p",
   "class": "wp-block-paragraph",
   "landmarks": [
    "main"
   ],
   "textLength": 149,
   "text": "The user-select property in CSS controls how the text in an element is allowed to be selected. For example, it can be used to make text unselectable.",
   "counts": {
    "links": 0,
    "images": 0,
    "headings": 0,
    "listItems": 0,
    "tableRows": 0,
    "controls": 0,
    "paragraphs": 1,
    "repeats": 1,
    "coverLinks": 0
   },
   "linkTextRatio": 0,
   "geometry": {
    "top": 384,
    "height": 191,
    "widthFraction": 0.6,
    "leftFraction": 0.17,
    "pageFraction": 0.02,
    "aboveFold": true
   }
  },
  {
   "index": 4,
   "tag": "pre",
   "class": "wp-block-csstricks-code-block language-css",
   "landmarks": [
    "main"
   ],
   "textLength": 196,
   "text": ".row-of-icons {\n -webkit-user-select: none; /* Chrome all / Safari all */\n -moz-user-select: none; /* Firefox all */\n -ms-user-select: none; /* IE 10+ */\n user-select: none; /* Likely future */ \n}",
   "counts": {
    "links": 0,
    "images": 0,
    "headings": 0,
    "listItems": 0,
    "tableRows": 0,
    "controls": 0,
    "paragraphs": 0,
    "repeats": 1,
    "coverLinks": 0
   },
   "linkTextRatio": 0,
   "geometry": {
    "top": 600,
    "height": 210,
    "widthFraction": 0.51,
    "leftFraction": 0.21,
    "pageFraction": 0.04,
    "aboveFold": true
   }
  },
  {
   "index": 5,
   "tag": "p×2",
   "class": "wp-block-paragraph",
   "landmarks": [
    "main"
   ],
   "textLength": 438,
   "text": "This is useful in situations where you want to provide an easier/cleaner copy-paste experience for users (not have them accidentally text-select useless things, like icons or images). However it’s a bit buggy. Firefox enforces the fact that any text matching that selector cannot be copied. WebKit still allows the text to be copied if you select elements around it.\nYou can also use this to enforce ",
   "counts": {
    "links": 0,
    "images": 0,
    "headings": 0,
    "listItems": 0,
    "tableRows": 0,
    "controls": 0,
    "paragraphs": 2,
    "repeats": 2,
    "coverLinks": 0
   },
   "linkTextRatio": 0,
   "geometry": {
    "top": 834,
    "height": 225,
    "widthFraction": 0.43,
    "leftFraction": 0.21,
    "pageFraction": 0.05,
    "aboveFold": false
   }
  },
  {
   "index": 6,
   "tag": "pre",
   "class": "wp-block-csstricks-code-block language-css",
   "landmarks": [
    "main"
   ],
   "textLength": 188,
   "text": ".force-select { \n -webkit-user-select: all; /* Chrome 49+ */\n -moz-user-select: all; /* Firefox 43+ */\n -ms-user-select: all; /* No support yet */\n user-select: all; /* Likely future */ \n}",
   "counts": {
    "links": 0,
    "images": 0,
    "headings": 0,
