   "tag": "p",
   "class": "wp-block-paragraph",
   "landmarks": [
    "main"
   ],
   "textLength": 179,
   "text": "In other words, it intelligently cascades and resets to a sensical state. It looks like maybe this feature could be used to make pseudo elements selectable, but no final word yet.",
